      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Greenville%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The mill also houses artifacts related to Anthony Wayne, the Treaty of Greenville, and Native American heritage.",
